  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Croptopia Delight</strong>&nbsp;是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>&nbsp;的擴充模組，提供 <strong>Farmer's Delight</strong> 與 <strong>Croptopia</strong> 之間的整合。</p>\n<pre>本模組會將 Croptopia 的食譜與 Farmer's Delight 及其擴充模組進行整合。</pre>\n<p>在 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/ray_lirov\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ray_Lirov</a> 的帶領下已恢復開發。</p>\n<pre>您也可以使用 <strong>datapack（數據包）</strong> 版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/croptopia-delight-dp\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a><br>我們也有 Modrinth 頁面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcroptopia-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></pre>\n<p>有問題嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord 提問<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/M4XttfXXDw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 連結</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>正在尋找遊戲伺服器託管服務嗎？我們的合作夥伴 Godlike Host 可以為您提供協助！</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgodlike.host%252fminecraft-java-servers-hosting%252f%253faff_id%253d1317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/932098/description_8a000688-8d49-42cd-9370-104cd5ac9b97.png\" width=\"575\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
